      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-179553",
      ":question/problem": "A survey conducted among $100$ artists found that $72$ of them use oil paints, $43$ of them use water paints, and $29$ artists use both types of paint. Draw a Venn diagram representing this sample space. If an artist is randomly selected among the $100$ artists, what is the probability that they use at least one of these types of paint?\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
